WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Agents change. Decisions persist.

00:04.000 --> 00:10.000
Preserve the choice, the reason, rejected alternatives, and conditions to watch.

00:10.000 --> 00:16.000
Give the next agent relevant decision context before it edits the code.

00:16.000 --> 00:22.000
Measured latency exceeds the recorded limit. The condition is checked deterministically.

00:22.000 --> 00:30.000
DecisionLoop flags the decision. A person reviews the evidence and chooses the response.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Give agents context. Keep decisions accountable. DecisionLoop, open-source 2.0 alpha.
